admin.create_intro:
Creating an excursion — step by step:
1) common parameters;
2) choose source text language (not UI language);
3) fill the text once in the source language;
4) auto-translate or manual RU / EN / IT with review;
5) up to 3 photos (optional);
6) review and publish.

The draft is saved to the database as you fill it in; a new creation starts only via “Add excursion”.

